items.fixSpec:
Add a 'laptops' group covering 1093x529, 1280x601, 1366x657, 1536x730, 1536x864 and 1920x937. For each viewport check:
- hero CTA is within the fold;
- gallery is pinned and every card fits (scrollHeight ≤ clientHeight, card bottom ≤ innerHeight);
- product hero CTA is within the fold;
- stage visual ≤ innerHeight - header;
- every beat visual has height > 0;
- the horizontal story pin exists;
- the first 40 Tab stops are visible;
- screenshots are saved to docs/review/<date>/laptops/.
Keep the existing reduced-motion, axe and console groups.

Make the nav a centred pill; glass is allowed here by DD-22, with a solid fallback under prefers-reduced-transparency. States:
- expanded at the top, all links visible at 1280px and wider;
- compact after 80px: symbol, current section or product chapter name, menu;
- contextual: a chapter label row for at most 2s when a horizontal chapter changes, with no aria-live;
- open: the router panel grows out of the pill.
Morph with transform or clip-path (GSAP Flip with scale:true), never by tweening width or height. Add --ease-spring: cubic-bezier(0.34,1.32,0.64,1) to tokens.css, used only here. Below 1280px use the compact pill. Keep the existing focus trap, Escape and focus return. Under reduced motion, switch states instantly.
